  "details": "Imagine where: In a small, dense, crowded places where Earmuff is not always the solution to hear specific near by users (due to density) OR you need to call someone's attention, or users attention are all over the place... You open the quick menu, click a user and click on \"Poke\" button, show a small but noticeable notification to the poked person and a thin line that shows where is the poking coming from for a few seconds. So the poked person finds the poker and the poker gets their attention. (Perfect for Drinking Night scenarios as one example). \n\nThis avoids users having to step on someone's personal space to get someone's attention or going AFK to ping on discord.\n\nMake it optional to avoid poking spam or abuse of the feature, or add other limits like, poking once every 1 minute.\n\nThanks 🙌",
